* are holes of some kind that creatures are getting through"). The floor slab
* in the picture ends at x 6895, but the room ran on to the rock wall at 6930,
* so creatures stood on 35 px of bare rock slope, and the room's south-east
* corner is where they sank through into the sealed rock under the floor
